-- s 37(1).
-- src:1097 | 37.—(1) When the seller is ready and willing to deliver the goods,
-- src:1098 | and requests the buyer to take delivery, and the buyer does not within
-- src:1099 | a reasonable time after such request take delivery of the goods, he is
