-- src:1101 | take delivery, and also for a reasonable charge for the care and
-- src:1102 | custody of the goods.
@ref s 37(1) (src:1097-1102)
GIVEN `the seller is ready and willing to deliver the goods` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the seller requests the buyer to take delivery` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the buyer does not within a reasonable time after the request take delivery of the goods` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the loss occasioned by the buyer's neglect or refusal to take delivery` IS A NUMBER
      `a reasonable charge for the care and custody of the goods` IS A NUMBER
